[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 22142.948, "timestamp": "06:09:02", "text": "不知道。好的。我，对我来说，我看看我是否"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 22145.43, "timestamp": "06:09:05", "text": "呃，第一次和某人交谈"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 22148.39, "timestamp": "06:09:08", "text": "我和他们聊了很多，然后我"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 22151.07, "timestamp": "06:09:11", "text": "自动假定他们是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 22155.19, "timestamp": "06:09:15", "text": "朋友，但另一方呃，不会是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 22158.15, "timestamp": "06:09:18", "text": "他们拥有同样的权利，只是他们的权利不同。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 22162.07, "timestamp": "06:09:22", "text": "他们的系统，嗯，为了他们自己"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 22164.868, "timestamp": "06:09:24", "text": "对，所以这就像取决于人一样。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 22169.23, "timestamp": "06:09:29", "text": "致所有爱的人。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 22171.91, "timestamp": "06:09:31", "text": "是啊，我之前都不知道还有这种事。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 22173.948, "timestamp": "06:09:33", "text": "人们"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 22176.83, "timestamp": "06:09:36", "text": "做。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 22179.19, "timestamp": "06:09:39", "text": "呃，兄弟跟每个人都聊过了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 22182.11, "timestamp": "06:09:42", "text": "自动就成了朋友。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 22186.19, "timestamp": "06:09:46", "text": "是啊，就像朋友那种关系。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 22188.868, "timestamp": "06:09:48", "text": "东西。我的天哪，我一直在看……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 22195.51, "timestamp": "06:09:55", "text": "东西。我的天，那一定是《老友记》！"}]